409 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 282 0 R
/T (While working in the St. Louis nonprofit community, our founder and executive director, Betsy Reznicek, noticed a critical gap. Families transitioning out of crisis were often handed the keys to an empty space with no beds, tables, or basic home essentials, and no single organization was equipped to meet the need. Betsy envisioned a dedicated furniture bank that could provide essential furnishings with dignity and efficiency. She partnered up with a small but determined group of community members, and together they turned that vision into reality.)
/E (While working in the St. Louis nonprofit community, our founder and executive director, Betsy Reznicek, noticed a critical gap. Families transitioning out of crisis were often handed the keys to an empty space with no beds, tables, or basic home essentials, and no single organization was equipped to meet the need. Betsy envisioned a dedicated furniture bank that could provide essential furnishings with dignity and efficiency. She partnered up with a small but determined group of community members, and together they turned that vision into reality.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
