/Title (Home Sweet Home prohibits all volunteers from manufacturing, distributing, dispensing, possessing, or using an illegal drug in or on company premises or while conducting company business. Volunteers are also prohibited from misusing legally prescribed or over-the-counter \(OTC\) drugs. Law enforcement personnel shall be notified, as appropriate, when criminal activity is suspected.)
